      ('Joint international consensus statement for ending stigma of obesity, Nature Medicine, 2020','https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-020-0803-x'),
      ('Long-term persistence of hormonal adaptations to weight loss, New England Journal of Medicine, 2011','https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa1105816'),
